    "body": "Thanks for the quick insight @annevk! Much appreciated ❤\n\nDo you think it would be valuable to put up a PR to document this sort of thing in the form element specification? My sense is that most developers probably know about DOM Clobbering on `window` and `document` — but I am now just learning about how prevalent this is on `form` elements.\n\nI haven’t ever attempted to submit a PR to this specification, but if you think it would be valuable, I could give it a whirl!",
