    "updated_at": "2025-04-17T18:27:16Z",
    "body": "When I look at https://html.spec.whatwg.org/dev/forms.html#the-form-element it seems quite clear to me where it talks about \"form[name]\". The same text is present in the version aimed at implementers: https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/forms.html#the-form-element.\n\nIf you think this could be further clarified it might well be good to submit a PR for evaluation. That makes it a bit more concrete what the problem might be.",
